    "description": "Are you a skilled Consultant Physician looking for your next big career move? Siemens Healthineers India Advisory Limited in Amritsar offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Siemens Healthineers India Advisory Limited:\nSiemens Healthineers India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor patient progress and adjust treatment plans accordingly\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Attend continuing medical education programs and training\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n• Maintain accurate clinical documentation in electronic health records\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n• Proficiency in ICD-10\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in Clinical Research\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Amritsar, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Siemens Healthineers India Advisory Limited!",
